<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Sticky Secretion</ansi> mutation

Your skin weeps a clear, adhesive sap — strike you and your attacker's
weapon and hand come away fouled and dragging.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive (Weaver)
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Uncommon

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Whoever strikes you tears free of the adhesive and is left slowed and
  clumsy, their follow-up swings dragging

